```

## Block Flattening Schema:
```
type: "the_flattening:flattening" [required as shown]
input: {
  id: [Item ID String, must refer to a block, required]
}
output: {
  id: [Item ID String, required]
  count: [Integer, Optional, defaults to 1]
}
```

